# An allowlist: send the Docker build only what the Dockerfile copies. The
# repository also holds raw downloads, a Python venv and several node_modules,
# none of which belong in the build context or the image.
*

!dashboard/
dashboard/node_modules
dashboard/dist

!server/
server/node_modules
server/data

!web/public/data/
!web/public/tiles/
!web/public/fonts/
